{
  "info": {
    "name": "Esteh — integrasi lokal",
    "_postman_id": "9d1f7a2e-esteh-lokal-0001-collection",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Data uji, localhost/LAN tepercaya; bukan produksi.\nUrutan folder mengikuti alur: setup → akun → katalog → penjualan/QRIS → koreksi → stok/pembelian → laporan.\nSemua POST memakai Idempotency-Key dari variable idempotencyKey (per-send unik).\nUntuk uji retry identik: isi variable fixedIdempotencyKey (environment) lalu kirim request yang sama dua kali; response harus identik.\nLogin otomatis menyimpan accessToken. Buat akun/produk lebih dulu karena request berikutnya memakai ID hasil test script.\nUpload bukti: pilih file foto pada tab Body (binary)."
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:3000"
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "const fixed = pm.environment.get('fixedIdempotencyKey');",
          "pm.variables.set('idempotencyKey', fixed ? fixed : pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}'));"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
